            <ArticleTitle>Nurse-managed cholesterol management programs offer clinical, financial rewards.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>102-6, 96</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Reap the benefits of an effective cholesterol management program. Only a small number of patients who could benefit from cholesterol-lowering therapy are actually receiving optimal treatment. However, a systemized approach to the management of such patients can deliver better control and lower costs down the road by preventing cardiac events. Find out the components of a successful cholesterol-lowering DM program, and get advice on how to implement your own program on a large or small scale.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
